{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"agent_message","text":"Selected responsibility: `FileChannel` operation delegation (`read/write/position/size/truncate/lock/map/transfer/force/close` and object forwarding).\n\nExtracted collaborator:\n- New class [`DelegatingFileChannel`](/data/henrique/langchain_prototype/codex/data/repositories/commons-io/src/main/java/org/apache/commons/io/channels/DelegatingFileChannel.java), package-private, focused only on delegating `FileChannel` behavior to an underlying wrapped channel.\n\nMethods/fields moved/extracted:\n- Moved `fileChannel` field and delegation implementations for:\n  - `force`, `implCloseChannel`, `lock`, `map`, `position()` / `position(long)`,\n  - `read(...)` overloads, `write(...)` overloads,\n  - `size`, `truncate`, `transferFrom`, `transferTo`, `tryLock`,\n  - `equals`, `hashCode`, `toString`.\n- `FilterFileChannel` now extends `DelegatingFileChannel` and keeps construction/builder API plus `unwrap()`.\n\nHow `FilterFileChannel` was simplified:\n- [`FilterFileChannel`](/data/henrique/langchain_prototype/codex/data/repositories/commons-io/src/main/java/org/apache/commons/io/channels/FilterFileChannel.java) now primarily handles:\n  - public API entry point,\n  - builder-based and direct construction,\n  - unwrapping.\n- Delegation responsibility is no longer directly implemented there, reducing its direct method burden.\n\nFiles changed:\n1. [`src/main/java/org/apache/commons/io/channels/DelegatingFileChannel.java`](/data/henrique/langchain_prototype/codex/data/repositories/commons-io/src/main/java/org/apache/commons/io/channels/DelegatingFileChannel.java)\n2. [`src/main/java/org/apache/commons/io/channels/FilterFileChannel.java`](/data/henrique/langchain_prototype/codex/data/repositories/commons-io/src/main/java/org/apache/commons/io/channels/FilterFileChannel.java)\n\nTest files changed:\n- None required.\n\nValidation command executed:\n1. `mvn -q -Djapicmp.skip=true -Drat.skip=true -Dcheck